  "releaseNotes": "Make skipComputed a required parameter in SchemaMigrator.Compare\nFix RelationManyList.UpdateAsync to update storage before mutating cache\nFix CreateAsync empty keyColumns and SetIdentity for non-identity read-only columns\nAdd IsComputed to DbColumnInfo, skipComputed in SchemaMigrator, all dialects\nAdd ColumnOverrideAttribute for inner schema nullability control\nAdd Precision/Scale to ColumnAttribute and SchemaColumn, compare in SchemaMigrator\nFix RelationSingle to use actual identity type instead of hardcoded long\nFix parameter collision in Union/Concat, MaxLength comparison in SchemaMigrator, GUID identity DDL",
